      "why_read": "This work revisits the debate between one-sided and two-sided RDMA, showing how intelligent use of two-sided RDMA with caching and batching can overcome its limitations. Readers will learn how a system called Lotus achieves superior performance in disaggregated memory databases by leveraging two-sided RDMA's rich functionality.",
